---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice" description="What personal data Bemba collects through the safari quote form, why, and how long we keep it.">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <section class="page-head">
      <Crumbs items={[{ name: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy/' }]} />
      <h1 class="h1">Privacy notice.</h1>
    </section>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><b>What we collect.</b> Only what you type into the safari request form: name, email, destination, travel month, number of travellers, budget and your message. We also store the page you sent it from and your country as detected by our hosting provider.</p>
      <p><b>Why.</b> To pass your request to up to three safari operators who can quote for your trip. That is the only use.</p>
      <p><b>Who sees it.</b> Bemba and the operators we match you with. Our site runs on Cloudflare, which processes data on our behalf.</p>
      <p><b>How long.</b> We delete requests 12 months after they are sent.</p>
      <p><b>Your rights.</b> Email <span class="mono">hello@bemba.com</span> to see, correct or delete your data.</p>
      <p><b>Analytics and cookies.</b> We do not use advertising cookies. Partner sites you visit through our links have their own policies.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
